*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
bun-debug.log*

# ============================================
# ENVIRONMENT & CONFIG
# ============================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
# Gercek env dosyalari deployment/<proje>/<tier>/<app>/.env olarak gitignore'lu kalir;
# commit'lenen tek sablon ilgili klasordeki .env.example'dir. (AGENTS-DEPLOYMENT.md)

# ============================================
# OS FILES
# ============================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ============================================
